   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Radial Burst\n\nA dot launches rounded ribbons that curl into a ring, spin shut and sweep out of frame in a bold geometric burst.\n\nCategory: shapes. Length: 4 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A logo sting, section opener or hard transition needs one bold geometric gesture.\n- You want a colorful, self-contained abstract shape moment with a clean exit.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The shape should stay on screen: it sweeps out of frame by the end.\n- A calm, minimal reveal is needed.\n\nVariables:\n- segments (number, 4-16): Segments, default 8\n- radius (number, 100-280): Burst radius, default 210\n- thickness (number, 8-60): Thickness, default 30\n- rotation (number, -360-360): Rotation, default 135\n- intensity (number, 0-1.5): Intensity, default 1\n- twist (number, -180-180): Ribbon twist, default 110\n- echoes (number, 0-5): Contour echoes, default 3\n- color (color): Shape color, default \"#ffffff\"\n- accent_color (color): Accent color, default \"#f4e4a7\"\n- background_color (color): Background, default \"#a800b7\"\n- speed (number, 0.25-3): Speed, default 1\n- loop (boolean): Loop, default false\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
